%% Logical companion to the native SVG; generated from the same service/edge definitions.
flowchart TB
  accTitle: AWS: one comparison, seven business steps
  accDescr: Submit to acceptance, durable outbox, confirmed queue, leased processing and atomic outcome. A durable owner event reaches React over SSE; targeted API reads return saved results. SQL transport and delivery are expanded in the focused views.
  Submit["1  Submit<br/>HTTPS entry + React<br/>Session, CSRF, retry key<br/>ALB → ECS/Fargate app"]
  Accept["2  Accept<br/>Django: supply + owner checks<br/>Reserve → upload → finalize<br/>Queued Job + durable Outbox"]
  Relay["3  Relay<br/>Read committed dispatches<br/>Reuse confirmed producer<br/>Publish UUID; mark after confirm"]
  Queue["4  Queue<br/>Amazon MQ: RabbitMQ quorum<br/>Persistent UUID deliveries<br/>Retries preserve logical identity"]
  Process["5  Process<br/>Fetch clean source; parse/cache<br/>Converse → validate quotes<br/>Current lease fences completion"]
  Save["6  Save<br/>One PostgreSQL transaction<br/>Outcome + report + inbox<br/>Owner revision + StreamEvent"]
  Read["7  Read<br/>EventSource wakes React<br/>GET affected state via Django<br/>Open saved notification/result"]
  Delivery["Delivery plane<br/>Ledger → event-relay → shards<br/>Raw ASGI gateway → SSE<br/>Durable replay after reconnect"]
  Source["Source gate<br/>Private S3 + GuardDuty gate<br/>Checksum + clean-tag access<br/>Separate original lifecycle view"]
  SQL["Shared SQL ingress<br/>RDS Proxy carries ordinary writes and read-only gateway replay; bootstrap connects directly."]
  Submit --> Accept
  Accept --> Relay
  Relay --> Queue
  Queue --> Process
  Process --> Save
  Save -->|"Committed change"| Delivery
  Delivery -->|"SSE"| Read
  Accept -.->|"202 receipt"| Read
